<title>USA: Continental Choice FY 96 net loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Continental Choice FY 96 net loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>FLORHAM PARK, N.J. 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr	   loss	 $0.10     loss	 $0.39</p>
<p> Net	   loss	   332     loss	 1,274</p>
<p> Revs			 5,752		    8,232</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   3,238		    3,238</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Continental Choice Care Inc said its net loss for fiscal year 1996 includes a gain of $1,749,000 on the sale of the company's former New Jersey In-Center Facility.</p>
<p>Net loss for fiscal year 1995 includes $547,976 in costs associated with a terminated merger transaction and the discontinuance of the the company's infusion business.</p>
</text>
